
Fact even Identified by 0..10
  Holds when even == 2
             , even == even' + 2 && even'
             , even == even' - 2 && even'
//  rules below work under "alternative semantics" (see branch)
// but cause division/rounding issues here?
//           , even(even/2) When even > 0
//           , even(0-(even/2)) When even < 0
.


// ?even(-4).
// ?!even(-3).
// ?even(-2).
// ?!even(-1).
?even(0).
?!even(1).
?even(2).
?!even(3).
?even(4).
?!even(5).
?even(6).
?!even(7).
?even(8).
?!even(9).
?even(10).
